Task	Command
Start lab	lab start reliability-probes
Deploy application	oc apply -f long-load-deploy.yaml
Check pod status	oc get pods or watch oc get pods
Exec to pod	oc exec deploy/long-load -- curl -s localhost:3000/health
Make pod unhealthy	/togglesick or /hiccup endpoints
Scale deployment	oc scale deploy/long-load --replicas N
Add readiness probe	oc set probe deploy/long-load --readiness --failure-threshold 1 --period-seconds 3 --get-url http://:3000/health
Finish lab	lab finish reliability-probes
